    "question": "Which uv command installs the latest Ruff tool?",
    "answer": "By default, `ruff-action` runs as a pass-fail test to ensure that a given repository doesn't contain any lint rule violations as per its [configuration](configuration.md). However, under-the-hood, `ruff-action` installs and runs `ruff` directly, so it can be used to execute any supported `ruff` command (e.g., `ruff check --fix`).",
